# Shepherd of the Clouds: "if you control a Mount" names a creature type, which a text-changing effect may change (CR 612.1).
# Bot1 controls no Mount. Bot1 casts Artificial Evolution on the Shepherd spell, changing Mount to Pegasus, a change the
# permanent keeps (CR 400.7a). The Shepherd is itself a Pegasus, so as its enters trigger resolves Bot1 controls a "Mount"
# and Alaborn Trooper returns to the battlefield, not to the hand. As printed (the without-a-Mount scenario) the Pegasus does
# not count.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Alaborn Trooper
Shepherd of the Clouds
Black Lotus
Artificial Evolution
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

